Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 13:05:31 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] nr: Implement the gNB, UE and DRX power models, driven
 from the PHY

Implement NrGnbEnergyModel (TR 38.864), NrUeEnergyModel (TR 38.840) and
NrUeDrxModel (TS 38.321), and drive them live from the PHY: the gNB
model from the SlotDataStats trace, the UE model with BWP-based
scaling. Add the initial unit test suite for all three, and the first
round of fixes found wiring them into a real simulation: gNB uplink and
control symbols charged at the correct power, UE reception charged by
allocated symbols and MIMO rank, several build/test failures, and
review feedback from the initial pass.
